OL,3,GNEWSAUnpaid carers given boxes of
OL,4,Awellbeing treats
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnpaid carers have received gift boxes
OL,7,Fin recognition of support they provide
OL,8,Fto other people.
OL,10,FThe boxes hold a range of items
OL,11,Fintended to remind carers to take some
OL,12,Ftime for themselves, including teabags,
OL,13,Fbiscuits and mugs.
OL,15,FSuzie Walters-Jeffries from Devon
OL,16,FCarers at Westbank said the project was
OL,17,Fdesigned to thank the 35,000 unpaid
OL,18,Fcarers across Devon who look after
OL,19,Fpeople with dementia, mental health
OL,20,Fissues, chronic illness and other
OL,21,Fhealth challenges.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
